### ──────────────────────────────────────────
### Flashcard API - REST Tests
### Requires: REST Client extension for VS Code
### Base URL: adjust @host if your port differs
### Note: MongoDB IDs are 24-char hex strings.
###   Replace {{id}} with a real _id from a POST response.
### ──────────────────────────────────────────

@host = http://localhost:8081
@baseUrl = {{host}}/api/flashcards
@id = 69cc6a89118c29bec1514fee

### ──────────────────────────────────────────
### 1. GET ALL flashcards
### ──────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ──────────────────────────────────────────
### 2. POST - Create a new flashcard
### ──────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Photosynthesis",
  "description": "The process by which green plants convert sunlight into food using CO2 and water."
}

###

### ──────────────────────────────────────────
### 3. POST - Create a second flashcard
### ──────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Mitosis",
  "description": "A type of cell division resulting in two daughter cells with the same number of chromosomes as the parent."
}

###

### ──────────────────────────────────────────
### 4. GET a single flashcard by ID
###    Replace @id at the top with a real _id
### ──────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ──────────────────────────────────────────
### 5. PUT - Update a flashcard by ID
### ──────────────────────────────────────────
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Photosynthesis (Updated)",
  "description": "Plants use sunlight, water, and CO2 to produce glucose and oxygen."
}

###

### ──────────────────────────────────────────
### 6. PUT - Partial update (description only)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Cell division producing two genetically identical daughter cells."
}

###

### ──────────────────────────────────────────
### 7. DELETE a flashcard by ID
### ──────────────────────────────────────────
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ──────────────────────────────────────────
### 8. GET a non-existent ID (expect 404)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ──────────────────────────────────────────
### 9. POST - Missing fields (expect 400)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Incomplete card"
}

###